uecomment-2517720200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/3011","id":2517720200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6WEVyI","user":{"login":"jrieken","id":1794099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1794099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken","html_url":"https://github.com/jrieken","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-04T15:12:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-04T15:12:41Z","body":"Any chance you can share the prompt and file with us?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2517720200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2517781700","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/3011#issuecomment-2517781700","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/3011","id":2517781700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6WEkzE","user":{"login":"jessehouwing","id":4173387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzMzODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4173387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing","html_url":"https://github.com/jessehouwing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessehouwing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-04T15:29:05Z","updated_at":"2024-12-04T15:29:05Z","body":"```pwsh\n... 900 more lines of pwsh code\n\nprocess-orgs -orgs $orgs\n#migrate-org -sourceOrg \"xebia-software-development\" -targetOrg \"xebia\" -allRepos -teams \"sl-xsd-nl\"\n#migrate-org -sourceOrg \"xebiaquality\" -targetorg \"xebia\" -migraterepos -teams \"sl-xt-nl\" -allRepos\n\n# Query for users who cannot currently receive emails because their email address isn't verified or routed correctly using the `canReceiveOrganizationEmailsWhenNotificationsRestricted` grapphql property on a uer\n\ngh api graphql -F org=\"xebia\" -f query='query($org: String!) {\n    organization(login: $org) {\n      samlIdentityProvider {\n        externalIdentities(first: 100) {\n          nodes {\n            user {\n              login\n              canReceiveOrganizationEmailsWhenNotificationsRestricted(login: $org)\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }' --paginate --jq '.data.organization.samlIdentityProvider.externalIdentities.nodes' | ConvertFrom-Json\n  \n  # Query for members of an enterprise  who do not have a secure 2FA enabled on their account using the `twoFactorMethodSecurity` property on the member\n\n# >>>> SELECTION START\ngh api graphql -F enterprise=\"xebia\" -f query='query($enterprise: String!) {\n  enterprise(slug: $enterprise) {\n    members(hasTwoFactorEnabled: true, twoFactorMethodSecurity:INSECURE first: 100) {\n      nodes{\n        ... on EnterpriseUserAccount{\n          login\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}' --paginate --jq '.data.enterprise.members.nodes' | ConvertFrom-Json\n# SELECTION END <<<<<\n```\n\nThe file I had was as above. With the highlighted code selected.\n\nThe prompt I passed into **inline chat** CTRL-I was:\n\n> Add pagination support to the GraphQL Query\n\nI tried adding `#selection`, the second time round, but that didn't work.\n\nI tried clicking \"(run without)\" quickly but that still did the same thing.\n\nWhen I switched to the chat window (not inline) and used:\n\n> Add pagination support to the GraphQL Query in the #selection\n\nThe query was successfully updated.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff638856-9233-4056-9e0d-75f55e100bcf)\n\nI've been running quite a few Copilot classes this week and I've seen Inline Chat often decide to completely ignore the selection. `/fix` has been trying to fix things outside of the selection and  other prompts have been expanding the prompt to cover more than the selection.\n\n\nAnother example I tried:\n\n```csharp\nprivate static readonly List<Plane> Planes = new List<Plane>\n        {\n            new Plane\n            {\n                Id = 1,\n                Name = \"Wright Flyer\",\n                Year = 1903,\n                Description = \"The first powered aircraft.\",\n                RangeInKm = 12\n            },\n            new Plane\n            {\n                Id = 2,\n                Name = \"Wright Flyer II\",\n                Year = 1904,\n                Description = \"Original Flyer with better performance.\",\n                RangeInKm = 24\n            },\n            new Plane\n            {\n                Id = 3,\n                Name = \"Wright Model A\",\n                Year = 1908,\n                // >>>>>>>>> START SELECTION\n                Description = \"The first two seater airplane.\",\n                // END SELECTION <<<<<<<<<<<<<\n                RangeInKm = 40\n            },\n        };\n```\n\nAnd then prompting:\n\n> The selected description is factually incorrect, please update it\n\nResulted in copilot switching to `/edit` and it proceeded to update the description for all planes in the list, not just the selection.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2517781700/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3627375081","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/3011#issuecomment-3627375081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/3011","id":3627375081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7YNVnp","user":{"login":"jrieken","id":1794099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1794099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken","html_url":"https://github.com/jrieken","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrieken/e